# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and wallets — NEVER commit.
#
# A committed private key is permanently public: rewriting history does not
# un-publish it, because clones and forks keep the old objects. Treat any key
# that lands here as burned and rotate it, exactly as the founder key was
# rotated in July after being generated inside a cloud-synced folder.
#
# The founder/premine key deliberately lives OUTSIDE this tree
# (C:\Users\MINE\Noct-Founder\). Keep it that way.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
!**/testdata/*.crt
.env
.env.*
*secret*
*.token
rpc-token
miners.txt

# Wallet state and its pins/caches — per-user, and the address pin identifies you
*.address
*.subaddr
*.cache
wallet.key*

# The demo wallet: a real private key on a retired chain. Worthless, but a
# private key in a public repo teaches the wrong habit and confuses readers.
demo/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chain and runtime state — machine-specific, large, regenerates from the network
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
blocks.dat
blocks.dat.*
peers.dat
*.log
noct/**/data/
.noct-testnet/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
target/
**/target/
node_modules/
desktop/dist/
desktop/out/
*.exe
*.msi
*.deb
*.tgz
*.tar.gz

# RandomX vendored C++ build tree (built locally; not source we maintain)
noct/randomx/RandomX/build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Local agent/editor tooling config — machine-specific, not project source
.claude/
